WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:01.870
- Heidi, you recently posted a throwback

00:00:01.870 --> 00:00:03.320
to your first Victoria Secret show.

00:00:03.320 --> 00:00:04.370
So what do you remember about it?

00:00:04.370 --> 00:00:05.487
Or do you remember about it?

00:00:05.487 --> 00:00:07.310
(Winnie whoops)
Cause it's gotta be chaotic.

00:00:07.310 --> 00:00:09.920
- Well, I mean, I should've
worn a matching set

00:00:09.920 --> 00:00:11.940
when I was rehearsing at home.
(Winnie laughs)

00:00:11.940 --> 00:00:13.290
I'm thinking, I mean yeah look,

00:00:13.290 --> 00:00:14.660
I put the carpet to the side.
- Oh my god.

00:00:14.660 --> 00:00:16.770
- This was a railroad apartment
that I had in New York

00:00:16.770 --> 00:00:19.640
and I just wanted to see what
it looks like when I walk,

00:00:19.640 --> 00:00:22.230
because also at that time
we didn't film ourselves

00:00:22.230 --> 00:00:24.490
as much as we do now with our phones.

00:00:24.490 --> 00:00:26.220
So I just wanted to
see what it looks like.

00:00:26.220 --> 00:00:29.150
I didn't want to be on one
of the biggest runways ever,

00:00:29.150 --> 00:00:31.690
for me, and you know, not
know what it looks like.

00:00:31.690 --> 00:00:34.970
So I walked in my heels up and
down that railroad apartment,

00:00:34.970 --> 00:00:37.530
to just, you know, till
I got used to being--

00:00:37.530 --> 00:00:39.410
- It's like rehearsing,
like we do with music,

00:00:39.410 --> 00:00:40.480
like on the stage.
- Yeah exactly.

00:00:40.480 --> 00:00:41.620
- Yeah, absolutely.

00:00:41.620 --> 00:00:42.800
Did you ever rehearse,

00:00:42.800 --> 00:00:44.810
do you do rehearse or
do anything like that?

00:00:44.810 --> 00:00:47.100
- I used to rehearse a lot.

00:00:47.100 --> 00:00:48.410
I used to watch a lot of, like,

00:00:48.410 --> 00:00:50.328
Heidi's videos, Naomi
Campbell and just like--

00:00:50.328 --> 00:00:51.895
- You came out of my womb with heels on

00:00:51.895 --> 00:00:52.728
(Winnie laughs)
and you were like

00:00:52.728 --> 00:00:53.820
"I know how it's done."
(laughter)

00:00:53.820 --> 00:00:55.880
- No, cause-- like it
was never something that

00:00:55.880 --> 00:00:59.050
my family was into, or you know like

00:00:59.050 --> 00:01:00.440
fashion, modeling, anything.

00:01:00.440 --> 00:01:02.560
So when I realized that it
was an opportunity for me,

00:01:02.560 --> 00:01:05.100
I was like, "Okay, anything
you're going to do in life,

00:01:05.100 --> 00:01:06.990
you gotta do it well so you gotta study,

00:01:06.990 --> 00:01:08.280
you gotta practice."

00:01:08.280 --> 00:01:09.610
- People don't realize how hard it is.

00:01:09.610 --> 00:01:11.910
I went to one fashion thing
and it was amazing because--

00:01:11.910 --> 00:01:13.870
I love all those colors by the way.

00:01:13.870 --> 00:01:16.040
But it was amazing because this girl,

00:01:16.040 --> 00:01:18.550
I mean, she was-- they dress you so fast.

00:01:18.550 --> 00:01:19.383
- [Heidi] Yeah.
- [Winnie] Oh my gosh.

00:01:19.383 --> 00:01:21.010
- It's like a pit stop at Formula 1.

00:01:21.970 --> 00:01:24.250
You come on and it's like (mimics a drill)

00:01:24.250 --> 00:01:25.510
They rip the thing off your head

00:01:25.510 --> 00:01:27.313
the wings come on and
shove you out the door.

00:01:27.313 --> 00:01:28.840
- They didn't do her face--

00:01:28.840 --> 00:01:31.640
- My quick change, like
literally so nervous.

00:01:31.640 --> 00:01:33.210
And they just like didn't
care. They were like--

00:01:33.210 --> 00:01:34.120
- They're already calling you.

00:01:34.120 --> 00:01:35.068
- Yeah.
- They're already like

00:01:35.068 --> 00:01:36.670
(Winnie and Heidi scream)

00:01:36.670 --> 00:01:38.930
- No, but you have to
trust those people a lot

00:01:38.930 --> 00:01:41.530
because this girl came out
in like a gladiator type

00:01:41.530 --> 00:01:44.117
tie and they didn't do it tight enough.

00:01:44.117 --> 00:01:46.590
And they fell and caught in her heel

00:01:46.590 --> 00:01:50.100
and she fell in front-- and
I was like "Oh my gosh."

00:01:50.100 --> 00:01:51.060
Like, and that wasn't her.

00:01:51.060 --> 00:01:52.940
It was just somebody, you
know, they were going so fast.

00:01:52.940 --> 00:01:54.930
And I was like "That's--
this is a gladiator."

00:01:54.930 --> 00:01:57.207
So I was like "That's hard."

